<title>HONG KONG: SCMP declares HK$0.05 3rd interim div.</title>
<headline>SCMP declares HK$0.05 3rd interim div.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third interim dividend for year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0  vs  5.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 South China Morning Post</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 2-4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 12</p>
<p>NOTE - South China Morning Post publishes the South China Morning Post newspaper and other publications. The third interim dividend period is from July 1, 1996, to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
